      },
      "acNaked": 11,
      "_acDerivation": "10 + Dex +1 + no armor (civvies AC 0) + no size mod (Medium). Looting Scale Mail in-run -> AC 15 (10 + 4 armor + 1 Dex).",
      "proficiencies": {
