    },
    "_skillBudgetNote": "L1 Fighter, Int -1: (2 + -1) x4 = 4 purchased skill points. Spent: Intimidate 3 + Climb 1 = 4. Climb's other rank + all of Swim = Pirate grants (not from budget). A LEGAL spend, not an 'optimal' one -- players spend how they play; the UI enforces rules (budget/cost/max-ranks), not choices.",
    "_featBudgetNote": "L1 Half-Orc Fighter feat budget = 1 general + 1 fighter-bonus (NO human bonus -- half-orc). Filled: Power Attack (chosen-general; prereq Str 13 ok @17) + Weapon Focus/Greataxe (chosen-fighter-bonus; prereq prof+BAB+1 ok). Greedy+Unsavory = Pirate background grants (off-budget). All prereqs met. LEGAL."
  },
